  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When heaven envies heroic geniuses expands to Book Mountain, Fairy Yu Xiu says the tribulation targets Fairy Feng Ya. She possesses talent Gu and has been in closed cultivation to deduce Limitless Demon Venerable’s arrangement. Wisdom path deductions expose the user, so heaven and earth start a tribulation to exterminate her. Fairy Yu Xiu refuses to send Divine Emperor City after Fang Yuan and insists the key is to protect Fairy Feng Ya.",
        "chapters": [
          2166
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_book_mountain",
          "char_fairy_yu_xiu",
          "char_fairy_feng_ya",
          "char_limitless_demon_venerable",
          "path_wisdom",
          "house_divine_emperor_city",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In a Legends of Ren Zu excerpt, after serious Gu and learning Gu appear on Carefree Wisdom Heart, a third Gu appears on her body and is called talent Gu. With self will Gu, learning Gu, and talent Gu she finds the true meaning of knowledge. At Book Mountain’s peak in Green Lotus Great World, Fairy Feng Ya takes the main seat. Her entire body is covered in a thin layer of dazzling light, named as the sign that she possesses talent Gu, while she forces Primordial Domain to appear.",
        "chapters": [
          2177
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "legend-birth",
